zu.requirements:
Iziqu ezingxenyeni ezedlule iminyaka emithathu (National Diploma/B-degree) kuleyo ndawo yokulawula abasebenzi noma kuleyo yokuyiqonda imfundo yabantu abasebenza embonini; kufanele ube nopilo onawo ochwepheshe okungenani iminyaka engu-3 ohlinzangamabanga aphezulu kule ndawo yokuphatha abasebenzi.
Amaxabiso: Ukuqonda okuvela kule minyakazo nezimiso eziguqula imithetho yokuphatha abasebenzi, okukhethekile okushiwo ngumthetho wokushintsha izenzo zabantu abasebenza ezikahulumeni, kanye nomthetho mayelana nekhomishani yezomsebenzeli: Ikhomishani yokuqasha, kanye nanoma iyiphi inkomba yomthetho weNkantolo Yokusebenza emisebenzini yomphakathi.
Ukwenza imisebenzi ethile ebeka izinto ezingabonwa ngabanye;
Ukwenza ukuthi kube nokuvakasha kwemihlangano ehlukene kanti futhi ulawule isikhathi sokuqashwa kwemisebenzi;
Ukubonisa ukuthi unesiphiwo futhi ungumuntu ongazange abe necala ekubhekene nezinkinga ezivela nsuku zonke; ukwazi ukusebenza ngaphansi kwengcindezi futhi ugcwalise isikhathi esihlongene.
Izindlela zokukhuluma (ezibhalwe nezikhulumi) kanti njalo izilimi ezimbili kwezintathu ezivunyelwe Western Cape.
